// Hybrid Classical/Quantum Kernel
// Demonstrates polyhedral classical scheduling fused with QIR quantum circuits.
//
// Naso's unified compiler allows classical pre/post-processing to be scheduled
// together with quantum circuits in a single compilation unit.

